      <body>
         
         <pb xml:id="leaf001r" facs="uva.00164.001.jpg" type="recto"/>
         
  <lg>
  <note type="authorial" place="top" rend="circled">Sent to Century accepted—paid</note>
            
  <head type="main" rend="underline">Old Age's <del hand="#h01" rend="overstrike"> its</del> <subst hand="#h01"><del seq="1" rend="overstrike">Mountain</del><add place="above" seq="2">Lambent</add></subst> Peak</head>
            
  <l>The touch of flame, the illuminating fire, the<lb/> <subst><del hand="#h01" rend="overstrike" seq="1">lofty</del><add hand="#h02" place="above" seq="2">loftiest</add></subst> <del hand="#h01" rend="overstrike">over</del>look at last.</l>
  <l><subst hand="#h01"><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">On</del><add seq="2" place="above">O'er</add></subst> city, passion, sea,—<subst hand="#h01"><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">on</del> <add seq="2" place="above">—o'er</add></subst> prairie, mountain,<lb/> wood—the earth itself;</l>
  <l>The airy, <subst hand="#h01"><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">luminous,</del><add seq="2" place="above">different,</add></subst> changing hues of all, in<lb/> falling twilight,</l>
  <l>Objects and groups, bearings, faces, reminiscences,</l>
  <l>The calmer sight—the golden setting, clear<lb/> and broad;</l>
  <l>So much i' the atmosphere, <add hand="#h01" place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a001">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" hand="#h01" xml:id="a001"><del rend="overstrike">the age,</del></add> the points of view,<lb/> the situation<add hand="#h02">s whence we scan.</add></l>
  <l>Bro't out by them <subst hand="#h01"><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">at last</del><add seq="2" place="above">alone</add></subst>—so much (perhaps<lb/> the best) unreck'd before,</l>
  <l>The <subst hand="#h02"><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">best</del><add seq="2" place="above">light</add></subst> indeed 
     <subst><del hand="#h01" rend="overstrike" seq="1">on</del><add hand="#h02" place="above" seq="2"><del hand="#h02" rend="overstrike" seq="3">by</del><add hand="#h02" place="above">? from <del hand="#h02" rend="overstrike">? of</del></add></add></subst> 
     them—old age's <del rend="overstrike">its</del> <subst hand="#h01"><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">mountain</del><add seq="2" place="above">lambent</add></subst><lb/> peaks.</l>
     <byline><hi rend="underline">Walt Whitman</hi></byline>
            
           
            
            
            
         </lg>
